{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2037, the world is rapidly <strong>dying out</strong> from pollution. The brand-new AI prototype was sent to the dying archipelago to clean it up. Let's see how he does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188090/extras/steam_gif_savetheworld.png?t=1744031472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188090/extras/savetheworld.gif?t=1744031472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world <strong>is changing in real time</strong> based on your actions! Trees and grass are growing, animals and birds are appeared or everything is dying...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188090/extras/steam_gif_title_craft.png?t=1744031472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188090/extras/gif_craft.gif?t=1744031472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect rubbish by yourself, with equipment or without or by automatization systems, then recycle or use it in your needs and craft new equipment or improve yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188090/extras/steam_gif_explore.png?t=1744031472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188090/extras/explore.gif?t=1744031472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The archipelago</strong> is filled with objects of interest and inhabitants. Explore the vastness of the archipelago, both <strong>by land</strong> or <strong>by underwater</strong>. Interact with animals, explore the world and uncover all the secrets of the Island Keeper world!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3188090?t=1744031472","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744031472","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188090/17b7984978d7fa7c59c024ce509b114f7178a0e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744031472","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188090/17b7984978d7fa7c59c024ce509b114f7178a0e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744031472","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2037, the world is rapidly <strong>dying out</strong> from pollution. The brand-new AI prototype was sent to the dying archipelago to clean it up. Let's see how he does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188090/extras/steam_gif_savetheworld.png?t=1744031472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188090/extras/savetheworld.gif?t=1744031472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world <strong>is changing in real time</strong> based on your actions! Trees and grass are growing, animals and birds are appeared or everything is dying...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188090/extras/steam_gif_ti